Output docs/assets/gifs/cli-mem.gif
Set Shell bash
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set FontSize 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set Framerate 15
Env NXY_ICONS "unicode"

Hide
Type "source /vhs/docs/assets/tapes/demo-home.sh" Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Type "nxy mem show" Enter
Sleep 3500ms
Type "nxy mem search IVA" Enter
Sleep 3500ms
